// Main changes:
// - WFO effectively reduced to one active Mode-2-style production mode.
// - CISD / UT / TMA are kept as context/dashboard logic, not hard entry blockers.
// - All forced WFO sets internally route to same active Mode 2 parameter set.
// - TP risk basis uses true stop risk, not ATR-capped risk.
// - Designed to avoid dead modes and keep HYPEUSDT.P 1m actively tradable.
// ============================================================================

